  "abstract_summary": "Search and recommendation serve a shared discovery objective but encode intent differently. We study this boundary through Dear Algo on Threads, a deployed product where open-ended requests such as \\emph{more NBA news} or \\emph{less politics} steer subsequent feed recommendations rather than return a one-shot result...",
